{"about_the_game":"In 1960s Japan, Shimizu Hinako's secluded town of Ebisugaoka is consumed by a sudden fog, transforming her home into a haunting nightmare.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs the town falls silent and the fog thickens, Hinako must navigate the twisted paths of Ebisugaoka, solving complex puzzles and confronting grotesque monsters to survive.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nImmerse yourself into Hinako's world imagined by renowned author Ryukishi07, with entrancing music, including pieces by Akira Yamaoka, and beautiful visuals in a gripping tale of doubt, regret, and inescapable choices. Will Hinako embrace the beauty hidden within terror, or succumb to the madness that lies ahead?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDiscover a new chapter in the SILENT HILL series, blending psychological horror with a haunting Japanese setting.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2947440?t=1741903246","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947440/813bfe777779595e10854e5233214ccc0af8b3a6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741903246","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947440/5e3091a7843d0f77c1517dc9ae1d020e10741d25/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741903246","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947440/5e3091a7843d0f77c1517dc9ae1d020e10741d25/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741903246","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains depictions of gender discrimination, child abuse, bullying, drug-induced hallucinations, torture, and graphic violence.\r\n\r\nThis game is set in Japan in the 1960s and contains depictions based on the customs and culture of that time. These depictions do not reflect the opinions or values of the developers or any individuals involv